\c 4  
\pi1
\v 1 Nebuchadnezzar the king,  
\pi1 to all the peoples, nations, and languages, who dwell in all the earth:  
\pi1 Peace be multiplied to you.   
\pi1
\v 2 It has seemed good to me to show the signs and wonders that the Most High God has worked toward me.   
\q2
\v 3 How great are his signs!  
\q3 How mighty are his wonders!  
\q2 His kingdom is an everlasting kingdom.  
\q3 His dominion is from generation to generation.   
